        </div>
        <p>The platform is designed to handle a high volume of market events without compromising responsiveness.</p>
        <ul class="guide-list [&_li::before]:content-['▸'] list-none p-0 [margin:8px_0_14px] [&_li]:[padding:5px_0_5px_22px] [&_li]:[position:relative] [&_li]:[font-size:15px] [&_li::before]:[position:absolute] [&_li::before]:[left:4px] [&_li::before]:[color:rgb(var(--primary))] [&_li::before]:[font-weight:700] dark:[&_li::before]:[color:rgb(var(--primary))]">
            <li><strong>Updates:</strong> Real-time, event-driven — prices and sizes refresh when the provider sends a change.</li>
            <li><strong>Live and Prematch:</strong> Both modes run in parallel, so you can monitor markets before and during the event.</li>
